@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram
'skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

'hide footbox


actor Editor
participant "AddCityUI" as UI

autonumber

note over UI : The UI collects city details from the Editor step by step.

UI --> Editor : Request city name
Editor -> UI : Input city name

UI --> Editor : Request coordinates (X, Y)
Editor -> UI : Input coordinates

UI --> Editor : Request number of house blocks
Editor -> UI : Input quantity

UI --> Editor : Request distribution type (Manual/Auto)
Editor -> UI : Selects distribution type

note right of UI : All required data is now collected\nand ready for processing.
@enduml


